{"page":220,"width":1658,"height":2523,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"274","words":[{"text":"274","x":187,"y":144,"width":57,"height":29}]},{"text":"5.9","words":[{"text":"5.9","x":177,"y":1638,"width":87,"height":34}]},{"text":"Chapter 5 (수P니 스케출렇","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":313,"y":144,"width":116,"height":27},{"text":"5","x":441,"y":144,"width":22,"height":22},{"text":"(수P니","x":490,"y":145,"width":52,"height":23},{"text":"스케출렇","x":550,"y":147,"width":83,"height":25}]},{"text":"프로세스에 우선순위를 쥐볂 사용자들은 큰 프로세스들을 작은 프로세스들의 집합으로","words":[{"text":"프로세스에","x":314,"y":265,"width":151,"height":35},{"text":"우선순위를","x":478,"y":265,"width":149,"height":37},{"text":"쥐볂","x":639,"y":268,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"사용자들은","x":717,"y":266,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"큰","x":872,"y":269,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"프로세스들을","x":913,"y":265,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"작은","x":1101,"y":265,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스들의","x":1173,"y":264,"width":186,"height":37},{"text":"집합으로","x":1377,"y":265,"width":124,"height":35}]},{"text":"나눌 것이다. 비대화형 프로세스보다 대화형 프로세스에 우선순위를 주면, 사용자들은","words":[{"text":"나눌","x":312,"y":323,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":391,"y":323,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"비대화형","x":505,"y":323,"width":114,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스보다","x":636,"y":324,"width":175,"height":36},{"text":"대화형","x":825,"y":323,"width":82,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스에","x":925,"y":323,"width":144,"height":36},{"text":"우선순위를","x":1086,"y":322,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"주면,","x":1254,"y":323,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"사용자들은","x":1344,"y":322,"width":157,"height":37}]},{"text":"컴퓨터를 대화형으로 A卜\u0026할 것이다. 이 문제는 일반적으로 완전한 조치의 집합을 캡슐","words":[{"text":"컴퓨터를","x":315,"y":380,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"대화형으로","x":449,"y":380,"width":148,"height":36},{"text":"A卜\u0026할","x":610,"y":382,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":712,"y":382,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":817,"y":382,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"문제는","x":857,"y":381,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"일반적으로","x":958,"y":381,"width":145,"height":36},{"text":"완전한","x":1116,"y":381,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"조치의","x":1222,"y":380,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"집합을","x":1331,"y":381,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"캡슐","x":1441,"y":381,"width":60,"height":35}]},{"text":"화한 도구 또는 스크립트를 시용하고, 해당 도구를 반복적으로 시용하며, 결괴를 측정하","words":[{"text":"화한","x":312,"y":439,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"도구","x":385,"y":441,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"또는","x":457,"y":440,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"스크립트를","x":529,"y":440,"width":147,"height":34},{"text":"시용하고,","x":688,"y":439,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"해당","x":824,"y":439,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"도구를","x":892,"y":441,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"반복적으로","x":991,"y":439,"width":148,"height":35},{"text":"시용하며,","x":1152,"y":439,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"결괴를","x":1300,"y":439,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"측정하","x":1408,"y":439,"width":94,"height":36}]},{"text":"는 동안 도구를 A卜\u0026하여(그리고 새로운 환경에서 발생하는 모든 문제점을 감지하여) 해","words":[{"text":"는","x":309,"y":499,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"동안","x":352,"y":496,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"도구를","x":425,"y":498,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"A卜\u0026하여(그리고","x":526,"y":496,"width":217,"height":39},{"text":"새로운","x":755,"y":497,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"환경에서","x":852,"y":495,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"발생하는","x":979,"y":496,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":1108,"y":498,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"문제점을","x":1180,"y":496,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"감지하여)","x":1319,"y":496,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"해","x":1471,"y":498,"width":27,"height":35}]},{"text":"결한다.","words":[{"text":"결한다.","x":311,"y":554,"width":97,"height":36}]},{"text":"예를 들어, 연구지들이 단말기 I/0의 양을 보고 프로세스들을 지동으로 대화형과","words":[{"text":"예를","x":366,"y":612,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"들어,","x":441,"y":612,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"연구지들이","x":526,"y":612,"width":142,"height":36},{"text":"단말기","x":685,"y":612,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"I/0의","x":787,"y":613,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"양을","x":889,"y":613,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"보고","x":960,"y":615,"width":58,"height":27},{"text":"프로세스들을","x":1032,"y":613,"width":184,"height":34},{"text":"지동으로","x":1231,"y":613,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"대화형과","x":1376,"y":613,"width":125,"height":37}]},{"text":"비대화형으로 분류하는 시스템을 설계하였다고 하자. 프로세스가 1초 이내에 단말기로","words":[{"text":"비대화형으로","x":309,"y":669,"width":181,"height":36},{"text":"분류하는","x":504,"y":670,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"시스템을","x":636,"y":670,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"설계하였다고","x":767,"y":670,"width":174,"height":36},{"text":"하자.","x":953,"y":670,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1033,"y":670,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"1초","x":1200,"y":673,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"이내에","x":1265,"y":671,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"단말기로","x":1374,"y":672,"width":125,"height":35}]},{"text":"입력하거나 출력하지 않는다면 그 프로세스를 비대화형으로 분류하고, 낮은 우선순위 큐","words":[{"text":"입력하거나","x":307,"y":728,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"출력하지","x":469,"y":728,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"않는다면","x":600,"y":728,"width":115,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":726,"y":733,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"프로세스를","x":766,"y":729,"width":146,"height":35},{"text":"비대화형으로","x":924,"y":729,"width":176,"height":36},{"text":"분류하고,","x":1110,"y":730,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"낮은","x":1256,"y":730,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"우선순위","x":1329,"y":730,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"큐","x":1468,"y":734,"width":31,"height":33}]},{"text":"로 이동시킨다. 이러한 정책은 한 프로그래머가 1초 내에 규칙적인 간격으로 임의의 문","words":[{"text":"로","x":304,"y":790,"width":32,"height":26},{"text":"이동시킨다.","x":350,"y":786,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"이러한","x":522,"y":786,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"정책은","x":625,"y":787,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":723,"y":787,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"프로그래머가","x":764,"y":787,"width":176,"height":36},{"text":"1초","x":952,"y":789,"width"