1284,"y":967,"width":72,"height":34},{"text":"사우자에","x":1373,"y":965,"width":123,"height":37}]},{"text":"의해 알고리즘이 특정 응용이나 응용 집힘에 맞도록 조정될 수 있게 한다. 예를 들면, 고","words":[{"text":"의해","x":302,"y":1022,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"알고리즘이","x":375,"y":1021,"width":147,"height":36},{"text":"특정","x":537,"y":1021,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"응용이나","x":606,"y":1021,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"응용","x":736,"y":1021,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"집힘에","x":807,"y":1021,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"맞도록","x":905,"y":1022,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"조정될","x":1005,"y":1022,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1106,"y":1023,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"있게","x":1152,"y":1024,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1224,"y":1024,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"예를","x":1309,"y":1025,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"들면,","x":1384,"y":1024,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"고","x":1468,"y":1029,"width":31,"height":26}]},{"text":"성능의 그래픽 기반 응용을 수행하는 워크스테이션은 웹 서버나 파일 서버외는 다른","words":[{"text":"성능의","x":302,"y":1080,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"그래픽","x":405,"y":1080,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"기반","x":510,"y":1080,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"응용을","x":578,"y":1080,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"수행하는","x":680,"y":1080,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"워크스테이션은","x":811,"y":1081,"width":206,"height":37},{"text":"웹","x":1030,"y":1081,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"서버나","x":1072,"y":1082,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"파일","x":1177,"y":1083,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"서버외는","x":1253,"y":1083,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":1393,"y":1083,"width":63,"height":35}]},{"text":"커플링 요구를 가질 수 있다. 일부 운영체제(특히, UNIX의 다수의 버전)는 시스템 관리","words":[{"text":"커플링","x":302,"y":1140,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"요구를","x":404,"y":1141,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"가질","x":506,"y":1139,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":576,"y":1140,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":619,"y":1138,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"일부","x":698,"y":1140,"width":